Gemmified-OpenGMK
=================

A fork of OpenGMK <https://github.com/OpenGMK/OpenGMK> that builds the GameMaker 8
emulator for WebAssembly and packages it as a GEMS-protocol plugin.

OpenGMK is licensed GPL-2.0-only and so is this fork; see LICENCE.md. Copyright in
the original work is retained by the OpenGMK authors and contributors.

Modifications in this fork are Copyright (C) 2026 Dapper Mink and are licensed
GPL-2.0-only on the same terms.

Third-party component
---------------------

The GeneralUser GS SoundFont by S. Christian Collins
<https://github.com/mrbumpy409/GeneralUser-GS> is not part of this repository's
source: it is downloaded at build time (assets/soundfont/soundfont.json pins its
bytes) and published next to each release. It is distributed under its own
licence, reproduced in assets/soundfont/LICENSE.txt, not under GPL-2.0-only.
